<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
  <div class="theme-card p-4 md:p-6">
    <div class="mb-6">
      <div class="theme-section-label mono mb-2">Legal</div>
      <h1 class="bebas mb-2 text-3xl leading-none md:text-4xl">Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="theme-subtitle mb-0">Basic GDPR-facing privacy information for launch. Replace placeholders with your real operator, contact details, vendors, and retention policy before shipping.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-5 text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-300">
      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">1. Who operates <%= theme_app_name %></h2>
        <p>Controller: <strong>[Your name / company]</strong><br>Contact: <strong>[email address]</strong><br>Address: <strong>[business address if required]</strong></p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">2. What data is processed</h2>
        <p>Account details you provide, match history, device/browser technical logs, and any support messages you send.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">3. Why the data is used</h2>
        <p>To provide login, save matches, secure the service, respond to support requests, and improve reliability.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">4. Legal bases</h2>
        <p>Contract performance, legitimate interests for security and maintenance, and consent where cookies or optional tracking are used.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">5. Storage and sharing</h2>
        <p>List hosting providers, email providers, analytics vendors, error tracking tools, and any processors outside the EEA. State retention periods clearly.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">6. Your EU rights</h2>
        <p>You should explain rights of access, rectification, deletion, restriction, portability, objection, and complaint to a supervisory authority.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">7. Cookies</h2>
        <p>If you add analytics, ads, or non-essential cookies, add a consent mechanism and document it here.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
